<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διᾱκόν-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>servants' business, service,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλικὰ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					175e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐγκύκλια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1255b25
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2811b24
			</span></i> (Aphrodisias, prob.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>service</i> rendered to a god, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.68c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>instruments</i> or <i>utensils of service,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.274b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				37.3
			</span></i>.</div>
